## Observability Strategy

MedSync employs a comprehensive observability strategy across metrics, logs, and traces to ensure system reliability and rapid incident detection.

---

## Observability Stack

### Core Tools

| Tool | Purpose | Coverage |
|------|---------|----------|
| Datadog | APM, metrics, logs, synthetics | Primary platform |
| Honeycomb | Distributed tracing | API services |
| PagerDuty | Alerting, on-call | All critical |
| Grafana | Custom dashboards | Supplementary |
| Splunk | Security logging | Security events |

### Data Flow

```
Applications → Datadog Agent → Datadog → Dashboards
                                     → Alerts → PagerDuty
                                     → Long-term storage
```

