## Metrics

### Infrastructure Metrics

| Category | Key Metrics | Collection |
|----------|-------------|------------|
| Compute | CPU, memory, disk, network | Datadog Agent |
| Kubernetes | Pod status, replicas, resources | Datadog Cluster Agent |
| Database | Connections, queries, replication | CloudWatch + Datadog |
| Cache | Hit rate, memory, connections | Datadog Redis |
| Network | Latency, throughput, errors | AWS + Datadog |

### Application Metrics

| Category | Key Metrics | Collection |
|----------|-------------|------------|
| HTTP | Requests, latency, errors | APM |
| API | Endpoints, response times, status | APM |
| Business | Transactions, users, events | Custom metrics |
| Dependencies | External calls, latency, errors | APM |

### SLI Metrics

| SLI | Metric | Target |
|-----|--------|--------|
| Availability | Successful requests / Total | 99.95% |
| Latency | p99 response time | < 500ms |
| Error Rate | Errors / Total requests | < 0.1% |
| Throughput | Requests per second | Per SLA |

