## Logging

### Log Levels

| Level | Usage | Example |
|-------|-------|---------|
| ERROR | Actionable failures | Exception, service failure |
| WARN | Potential issues | Retry, degradation |
| INFO | Business events | Request completed |
| DEBUG | Development detail | Variable values |

### Log Standards

| Field | Required | Example |
|-------|----------|---------|
| timestamp | Yes | 2025-01-15T10:30:00Z |
| level | Yes | INFO |
| service | Yes | api-gateway |
| trace_id | Yes | abc123 |
| message | Yes | Request processed |
| user_id | If applicable | usr_456 |
| customer_id | If applicable | cust_789 |

### Log Retention

| Log Type | Hot Storage | Cold Storage | Total |
|----------|-------------|--------------|-------|
| Application | 30 days | 1 year | 1 year |
| Security | 90 days | 7 years | 7 years |
| Audit | 90 days | 7 years | 7 years |
| Debug | 7 days | — | 7 days |

