## Alerting

### Alert Severity

| Severity | Response | Notification |
|----------|----------|--------------|
| Critical | Immediate page | PagerDuty high-urgency |
| Warning | Investigate soon | PagerDuty low-urgency + Slack |
| Info | Awareness | Slack only |

### Alert Standards

| Element | Requirement |
|---------|-------------|
| Name | Descriptive, actionable |
| Description | Context, impact, runbook link |
| Query | Clear, tested |
| Threshold | Based on SLO/baseline |
| Escalation | Defined path |
| Runbook | Linked |

