## Best Practices

### Instrumentation

| Practice | Guideline |
|----------|-----------|
| Custom Metrics | Use sparingly, clear naming |
| Logging | Structured JSON, appropriate level |
| Tracing | Propagate context, sample appropriately |
| Tags | Consistent, discoverable |

### Alert Hygiene

| Practice | Frequency |
|----------|-----------|
| Review noisy alerts | Weekly |
| Tune thresholds | Monthly |
| Update runbooks | With changes |
| Audit coverage | Quarterly |

